{"id":"000W5H","title":"Fidget (Between Renban Palindrome)","author":"tallcat","solvedCount":13,"difficulty":4,"rating":"100 %","firstSeen":"2026-11-24T12:40:05+00:00","posted":"Heute, 05:00 Uhr","rules":"I've always been a fan of deductions involving geometry - and even more so if it's across a large part of the grid. These puzzles - for me - nearly always come about from random drawing in the grid and this was no exception. Funnily enough, about the same time I set this puzzle, James Sinclair put out a puzzle \"Royalty\" with an identical renban shape in - a complete coincidence (although I can certainly recommend that puzzle if you haven't done it). Happy solving!\n\nNormal sudoku rules apply\n\nBetween Lines: Cells along lines between two filled circles must have values between those in the circles.Digits may repeat on lines if allowed by other rules.\n\nRenban: Pink lines must contain a set of consecutive, non-repeating digits in any order.\n\nPalindrome: Digits an equal number of cells away from the dotted center of a line are the same.\n\nCan be found at Sudokupad","solutionCode":"Column 5 (Top to bottom). 9 digits, no spaces.","tags":["Sudoku","Renban (Variante)","Palindrome (Variante)","Between (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/0ctlhhx84e","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/0ctlhhx84e","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","overlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-24T12:40:05+00:00"}